<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-CANBERRA WATCH-Budget bills update for Dec 10 - overview.</title>
<headline>RTRS-CANBERRA WATCH-Budget bills update for Dec 10 - overview.</headline>
<byline>Bradley Perrett</byline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canberra Watch has little to report that is different to Monday's situation, which is disturbing, because on Monday afternoon we had just four days of sittings left for the year.</p>
<p>Now we have three days, and the Telstra privatisation bill is still not finished.</p>
<p>The contentious budget bills -- containing doubtful measures worth about a quarter of the government's fiscal tightening -- are all queued up behind the Telstra bill.</p>
</text>
